  <Client>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9306b621eeae437439044a22699d6427, type: 2}
  <TextContent>k__BackingField: 'Little one,

    I have heard from your Grandmother
    that you''re taking the reins of the potion making business, very good! Everyone
    has to earn their bread don''t they?

    I do have an order for you. See, one
    of my precious plants hasn''t been doing so well lately. She would need a Watering
    Solution to regain her former vitality.

    Sincerely,'
  <LetterType>k__BackingField: 0
